  m_text: "Congratulations, Explorer! \L Just like Hiram Bingham, who brought Machu
    Picchu to the world\u2019s attention in 1911, you\u2019ve reached the end of
    your extraordinary journey.\L But is it really the end?\L Stay a little longer,
    feel the magic of this place, and relax in the shadow of the majestic mountains.
    Check out the hotel offers and choose the perfect spot to continue your adventure
    in Machu Picchu."
